IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hesa-help-formulas`

-- Higher Education Support Act 2003, ss 140-10(1A), 140-25, 140-26(2), 154-20, 154-25 -- worked cases for hesa-help-formulas.l4.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Expected values were worked by hand from the
-- sidecar formulas before running. AWE figures ($3,800 for 2025-26, $4,000 for 2026-27) are ILLUSTRATIVE.

§ `ss 140-25(1), 140-26(2) -- the accumulated debt`

-- The Act's Paula example under s 140-25(1): $20,000 + $1,500 = $21,500, as the first pass inferred (its case stands).
#ASSERT `the accumulated HELP debt` 20000 1500 0 0 EQUALS 21500
-- For 2024-25 (s 140-26(2)): $20,000 + ($1,500 - $500) x 0.8 = $20,800.
#ASSERT `the accumulated HELP debt for 2024-25` 20000 1500 500 0 EQUALS 20800
-- With a $1,000 location-preferred reduction: $19,800; cents disregarded: $10,000.50 + 0 gives $10,000.
#ASSERT `the accumulated HELP debt for 2024-25` 20000 1500 500 1000 EQUALS 19800
#ASSERT `the accumulated HELP debt for 2024-25` 10000.5 0 0 0 EQUALS 10000

§ `s 154-25 -- the thresholds for a year`

-- 2026-27: $67,000 x 4,000 / 3,800 = $70,526; $125,000 x 4,000 / 3,800 = $131,578. 2025-26: the stated figures. Before: none.
#ASSERT `the minimum repayment income for the year` 2026 4000 3800 EQUALS JUST 70526
#ASSERT `the upper repayment threshold for the year` 2026 4000 3800 EQUALS JUST 131578
#ASSERT `the minimum repayment income for the year` 2025 3800 3800 EQUALS JUST 67000
#ASSERT `the minimum repayment income for the year` 2024 3800 3800 EQUALS NOTHING
-- $100,000 in 2026-27, debt $20,000: 15% of ($100,000 - $70,526) = $4,421.10, under 10% and the debt. In 2025-26 the first
-- pass's own case gives $4,950 on the stated thresholds; the same here.
#ASSERT `the compulsory repayment amount for the year` 2026 4000 3800 100000 20000 EQUALS JUST 4421.1
#ASSERT `the compulsory repayment amount for the year` 2025 3800 3800 100000 20000 EQUALS JUST 4950

§ `s 140-10(1A) -- a reduced indexation factor`

#ASSERT `the reduced HELP debt indexation factor` 1.032 100 EQUALS 1.023
